<title>USA: Conair Corp revises dates of stock split.</title>
<headline>Conair Corp revises dates of stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GARDEN CITY PARK, N.J. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conair Corp said Tuesday it has changed the record and payable dates of its four-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The stock split will now be available to shareholders of record on January 17, and payable on January 31, the company said.</p>
</text>
